<title>PHILIPPINES: A.Brown 1996 net at 205.237 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>A.Brown 1996 net at 205.237 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property developer and chemicals manufacturer A.Brown Company Inc said on Wednesday it posted a net income of 205.237 million pesos for 1996.</p>
<p>The results announcement did not give a comparative year-ago figure. But A.Brown had earlier reported a net income of 214.3 million pesos in 1995.</p>
<p>Revenues of the company totalled 1.578 billion pesos in 1996. Expenses amounted to 1.306 billion pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 817267</p>
</text>
